      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "These spacious 3-bedroom homes are designed with comfort and practicality in mind. Extending over 108sq.m / 1,162 sq. ft, these A2-rated homes combine modern design with superior energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nLocated in the coastal yet well-connected Balbriggan, Hampton Demesne is a carefully considered new neighbourhood offering a high standard of contemporary living. With generous green spaces a new public park with playgrounds, games areas, outdoor gym, a skateboard plaza and a bike track. It brings a sense of openness throughout and is a place designed to support everyday life and bring people together.\r\n\r\nThe collection of two-, three- and four-bedroom homes is arranged around landscaped areas, with wide pathways and streets that encourage walking, cycling and a natural sense of community.\r\n\r\nEvery home at Hampton Demesne is designed for modern family living, with interiors that balance timeless style and practical features. Intelligent layouts, high-quality kitchens and fitted units, considered finishes and a strong attention to detail create spaces that are both functional and built to last.\r\n\r\nAll of the homes in this initial phase will be made available to eligible buyers through the Starter Home Purchase Scheme, which is managed jointly by Fingal County Council and the LDA. With the application of government supports and equity contributions, prices for these Starter Homes begin at €330,000 for two-bed houses; €370,000 for three-bed houses; and from €430,000 for four-bed houses.\r\n\r\nSet across 25 hectares on the southern edge of Balbriggan, Co. Dublin, the project will support one of Ireland’s youngest and fastest-growing populations with high-quality, sustainable homes and imaginative public spaces. For further information on this scheme, go to www.hamptondemesne.com or to apply for the scheme visit: https://www.fingal.ie/hampton-demesne-balbriggan."
      },
      {
